high 2850 (bar 114).", "Bars 1-7 close 2006.31, 2006.06, 1859.02, 1813.04, 1731, 1581.32, 1568.55 (seven consecutive lower closes); bar 7 spans 1599.27-1368.42 and closes 1568.55, well above its low.", "Bars 8-44 stay inside 1512.91 (bar 27 low) and 1845.09 (bar 16 high); no close exceeds 1845.09, and lows after bar 27 rise (1551.6, 1560.05, 1597.72, 1694.74, 1751.07).", "Bars 45-58 print higher highs 1891.66, 1944.39, 1954.36, 1974.46 with pullbacks only to 1848.82/1850.53; bars 62-80 then hold a roughly 19-bar band above 1821.49 (bar 65 low).", "Bars 81-83 are three large bull trend bars closing 2252.16, 2326.32, 2515.3; bar 81 opens at the prior close 1916.51 and bar 83 reaches 2771.", "Bars 84-107 spend 24 bars inside 2357.18 (bar 95 low) and 2557.46 (bar 89 high); upside attempts fail to hold: bar 104 high 2680 closes 2514.72, bar 107 high 2609.02 closes 2514.07.", "Bar 108 prints 2358.62, slightly above the 2357.18 low (bar 95); bars 111-114 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9, 2775.61, all above the 2557.46 range top.", "Bars 115-120 overlap between 2633.31 (bar 117 low) and 2786.81 (bar 116 high), closing 2752.43, 2684.16, 2686.59, 2690.56, 2694.96, 2685.9; no print above 2850 since bar 114.", "Last bar (120) 2694.96/2718.83/2668.55/2685.9 is a small-range, doji-like bar fully contained inside bar 116's 2752.43-2641.37 range."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear leg: seven lower closes with the largest bear bar last (1599.27-1368.42, close 1568.55), leaving a long lower tail above the window low 1368.42 - a selling-climax shape at the bottom.", "end_time_ms": 1780704000000, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780185600000, "upper_boundary": "2035.94"}, {"description": "Broad two-sided range after the low: about 37 overlapping bars capped by 1845.09 (bar 16) and floored by 1512.91 (bar 27); later bars inside it make successively higher lows.", "end_time_ms": 1783900800000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1845.09"}, {"description": "Rising leg from 1773.57 to 1974.46 (bar 58) with higher highs and only shallow pullbacks, then a flattening ~19-bar base that holds above 1821.49 before the spike.", "end_time_ms": 1787097600000, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "1773.57", "start_time_ms": 1783987200000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike of three large trend bars (bars 81-83) closing 2252.16, 2326.32, 2515.3 and running 1905.63 to 2771.", "end_time_ms": 1787270400000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-spike trading range of 24 bars between 2357.18 (bar 95) and 2557.46 (bar 89); two upside attempts (bar 104 high 2680, bar 107 high 2609.02) closed back inside.", "end_time_ms": 1789344000000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2557.46"}, {"description": "Bull breakout leg: bar 108 holds a higher low 2358.62, then bars 111-114 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9, 2775.61, accepting above the 2557.46 range top and printing the window high 2850.", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789430400000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Six-bar tight pause just under the high: bars 115-120 overlap between 2633.31 and 2786.81 with flat closes near 2685-2752, holding above the old 2557.46 range top.", "end_time_ms": 1790467200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790035200000, "upper_boundary": "2786.81"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Two consecutive closes above 2786.81 (bar 116 high) would confirm the pause resolved upward and extend the bull leg beyond the 2850 high.", "A close back below 2557.46 (post-spike