 from close 2659.00 (1790164800000) to 2667.86 is only +8.86 points - two-sided range behavior rather than a trending leg.", "Swing highs after the spike decline (2786.81 at 1790136000000, 2740.42 at 1790323200000, 2718.83 at 1790496000000) while lows hold near 2633.31/2637.00, a converging, overlap-heavy structure consistent with a range.", "The tight 13-bar sub-range held 2665.14-2718.83 with the window's lowest volumes, and its two-bar downside break stopped at 2636.28, above the range low 2633.31 - a failed escape rather than an accepted breakout.", "The latest leg is down inside the range: closes fell from 2717.24 (1790481600000) to 2645.21 (1790568000000), and bars 1790553600000 and 1790568000000 closed near their lows (2650.74 vs 2643.44; 2645.21 vs 2637.00), which keeps the latest Always-In short even though relevance is low inside a range.", "Price at 2667.86 sits below the approximate middle of the 2633.31-2786.81 range (near 2710), so pressure leans toward the lower boundary rather than balanced."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window covers 120 closed H4 bars (1788868800000-1790596799999); first close 2497.60, last close 2667.86, net +170.26 points (+6.8%) with a full up-down-up cycle inside the window.", "Window extremes: lowest low 2358.62 at 1789488000000; highest high 2850 at 1789977600000; highest close 2775.61 at 1790020800000 and no close above it since.", "Bull leg 2358.62 -> 2850 (1789488000000-1789977600000, 35 bars) shows mostly bull bars closing near highs (2578.60, 2636.28, 2723.15) and shallow 1-3 bar pullbacks, i.e. a spike/channel advance.", "Since the 2850 high, 41 bars (1790006400000-1790596799999) have overlapped between 2633.31 and 2786.81; swing highs step down (2786.81 at 1790136000000 -> 2740.42 at 1790323200000 -> 2718.83 at 1790496000000) while lows flatten (2648.49 at 1790164800000, 2633.31 at 1790236800000, 2637.00 at 1790568000000, 2636.28 at 1790582400000).", "A 13-bar tight sub-range at the low end (1790366400000-1790539200000) held 2665.14-2718.83 with the smallest bars and lowest volume of the window (1.91M-3.93M vs 7-10M in the trend legs).", "That tight sub-range broke down on two bars: 1790553600000 closed 2650.74 (low 2643.44) and 1790568000000 closed 2645.21 (low 2637.00); the break stopped at 2636.28, still above the wider range low 2633.31, and volume rose to 6.4M-8.1M on the last four bars.", "Final bar 1790582400000: open 2645.21, low 2636.28 (0.72 below the prior bar's 2637.00), close 2667.86 at the top of a 31.7-point range - a bull reversal bar back inside the prior tight sub-range."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "trading-range", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bull leg and spike from the window low 2358.62 (1789488000000) to the window high 2850 (1789977600000) in 35 bars: mostly bull bars with closes near bar highs (2578.60 at 1789732800000, 2636.28 at 1789747200000, 2723.15 at 1789977600000) and shallow one-to-three bar pullbacks, with acceleration into 2850.", "end_time_ms": 1789977600000, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Post-spike trading range: 41 bars from 1790006400000 to the decision bar, contained between 2633.31 and 2786.81, with heavy bar overlap, a lower-high sequence (2786.81 -> 2740.42 -> 2718.83) and flattening lows (2648.49, 2633.31, 2637.00); no close above 2775.61 in this span. Approximate mid of the range is near 2710, so current price sits in the lower half.", "end_time_ms": 1790596799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790006400000, "upper_boundary": "2786.81"}, {"description": "Downside break attempt out of the tight 13-bar sub-range 2665.14-2718.83 (1790366400000-1790539200000): bars 1790553600000 and 1790568000000 closed near their lows at 2650.74 and 2645.21 and reached 2636.28, which failed to reach the wider range low 2633.31 and was answered by a bull reversal bar closing at 2667.86.", "end_time_ms": 1790596799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2636.28", "start_time_ms": 1790366400000, "upper_boundary": "2718.83"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Acceptance out of the upper boundary: a close above 2740.42 with follow-through, and especially above 2786.81, would end the lower-high sequence and shift the read from range toward a bull continuation/breakout.", "Range breakdown: a close below 2633.31 with follow-through would break the floor that has held since 1790236800000 and shift the read from range toward a bear leg or range breakdown.", "Repeated failure at 2718.83/2740.42 while lows stay above 2633.31 would confirm the converging lower-high range rather than a breakout in either direction.", "A second test of 2636-2633 that fails with another bull bar closing near its high would strengthen range-low defense and weaken the short Always-In, while a close back above 2718.83 would flip the short-term pressure to bull."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2659.73", "close_time_ms": 1790182799999, "high": "2666.01", "low": "2641.37", "open": "2658.15", "open_time_ms": 1790179200000, "volume": "2452881.85"}, {"close": "2665.44", "close_time_ms": 1790186399999, "high": "2668.02", "low": "2649.16", "open": "2659.73", "open_time_ms": 1790182800000, "volume": "1997918.483"}, {"close": "2668.2", "close_time_ms": 1790189999999, "high": "2672.55", "low": "2658.43", "open": "2666.02", "open_time_ms": 1790186400000, "volume": "1691460.012"}, {"close": "2676.47", "close_time_ms": 1790193599999, "high": "2681.21", "low": "2664.47", "open": "2668.2", "open_time_ms": 1790190000000, "volume": "1829822.575"}, {"close": "2669.46", "close_time_ms": 1790197199999, "high": "2677.38", "low": "2668.11", "open": "2676.47", "open_time_ms": 1790193600000, "volume": "1351035.171"}, {"close": "2676.29", "close_time_ms": 1790200799999, "high":